    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 30-layer alternating dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), repeating 15 times (30 layers total, starting with HfO2). Optimize all 30 layer thicknesses with initialization bounds 60-130 nm per layer. Use gradient_thickness optimizer with perturbation amplitude increased from previous iteration and robustness penalty coefficient reduced by 50%. Maximize mean transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and mean reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Normal incidence, unpolarized light. Total layer count fixed at 30. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from catalog.",
